rust","description":"Enjoy a walk around the lakes at Stowe, discovering ornate temples & spotting wildlife. Admire intricate mosaics in the Pebble Alcove & play with echoes inside the Hermitage. Recently upgraded paths allow pushchair & wheelchair access. Some gravel & gates"},4290,[52.02159,-1.02182,52.02916,-1.00469],[455,454,543,544,545,546,478,477,476,475,474,547,548,549,456,457,463,550,551,461,460,459,458,464,465,552,452,453,491,472,553,451,454,455,473,493]],[19207598,"f",{"name":"Stowe's 'Stowedrops' Walk, Stowe","network":"lwn","distance":"4.0","operator":"National Trust","website":"https://static.nationaltrust.org.uk/trails/visit/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/stowe-gardens/stowes-stowedrops-walk-walking.pdf"},4546,[52.02159,-1.01578,52.03201,-1.00469],[455,454,554,438,555,556,557,558,430,559,552,465,464,560,561,562,563,457,456,549,564,547,474,475,565,566,567,568,569,570,571,572,573,574,575,576,577,578,436,567,452,453,491,490,451,455,454,579,580,473]],[19210725,"f",{"name":"The Path of the Brave, Stowe","network":"lwn","distance":"5.9","operator":"National Trust","description":"Get fit in beautiful surroundings. A 5k run or walk that takes in just about every noteworthy spot at Stowe.","website":"https://nt.global.ssl.fastly.net/binaries/content/assets/website/national/regions/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/places/stowe-gardens/pdf/2022-bhh-map-updated-october.pdf"},7488,[52.02159,-1.02456,52.03746,-1.00469],[450,455,454,581,582,459,583,584,585,468,586,587,588,589,590,428,591,592,555,438,439,440,441,442,593,594,595,488,487,486,485,447,484,483,482,481,576,577,596,434,597,546,478,477,476,475,474,547,564,549,456,598,550,551,461,599,600,601,602,603,449,448,489,492,490,491,452,453,451,454,455,493]],[19210865,"f",{"name":"The Path of Contentment, Stowe","network":"lwn","distance":"3.0","operator":"National Trust","description":"Stowe attracts people for all sorts of reasons. Many come here for wellbeing. Walking here, and resting there, induces calm and serenity. Following this path, with recommended picnic and beauty spots, should instill in you a deep sense of ease.","website":"https://nt.global.ssl.fastly.net/binaries/content/assets/website/national/regions/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/places/stowe-gardens/pdf/2022-bhh-map-updated-october.pdf"},2717,[52.02159,-1.01345,52.03006,-1.00469],[491,579,553,451,452,604,454,455,455,454,549,548,547,474,475,565,566,567]],[19210890,"f",{"name":"The Royal Route (Classic Route), Stowe","network":"lwn","distance":"4.0","operator":"National Trust","description":"Created in Spring 2022 to commemorate the Platinum Jubilee of HM Elizabeth II. Journey around the gardens to explore Stowe's royal links, visits, and monuments. Take the classic route for a gentler walk and introduction to our royal highlights.","website":"https://nt.global.ssl.fastly.net/binaries/content/assets/website/national/regions/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/places/stowe-gardens/pdf/2022-bhh-map-updated-october.pdf"},4182,[52.02159,-1.02182,52.02918,-1.00469],[589,590,428,429,430,431,432,433,597,545,544,543,552,465,464,560,561,562,563,457,456,454,455,455,454,456,598,462,461,460,459,583,584,605,606,588,452,453,450,451,473]],[19211327,"f",{"name":"The Royal Route (Extended Route), Stowe","network":"lwn","distance":"6.0","operator":"National Trust","description":"Created in Spring 2022 to commemorate the Platinum Jubilee of HM Elizabeth II. Journey around the gardens to explore Stowe's royal links, visits, and monuments. Choose the extended route for the full experience and royal highlights.","website":"https://nt.global.ssl.fastly.net/binaries/content/assets/website/national/regions/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/places/stowe-gardens/pdf/2022-bhh-map-updated-october.pdf"},5891,[52.02159,-1.02182,52.03402,-1.00469],[452,453,450,428,429,558,557,556,555,438,439,440,441,442,593,594,595,488,488,595,607,608,609,449,489,610,445,444,611,435,434,597,545,544,543,552,465,464,560,561,562,563,457,4